sue to open that page in Edit.","position":{"start":{"line":10,"column":1},"end":{"line":10,"column":1}},"key":"hl5ugJ2XJw"}],"key":"diSbInTHYt"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":12,"column":1},"end":{"line":12,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Errors block Build. They include invalid or duplicate export paths, missing pages, unsupported Notebook pages, malformed YAML frontmatter, duplicate or unresolved common cross-references, missing citation keys, and missing or damaged managed resources. Warnings identify empty pages, a missing Book author, or other items that can still produce a website.","position":{"start":{"line":12,"column":1},"end":{"line":12,"column":1}},"key":"MlfXUK7wCo"}],"key":"ezClLKZsXC"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":14,"column":1},"end":{"line":14,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"The preflight is intentionally conservative. The official strict Jupyter Book build remains the final syntax check and can report MyST features that the local checker does not interpret.","position":{"start":{"line":14,"column":1},"end":{"line":14,"column":1}},"key":"uLjYKde5S1"}],"key":"qXaUks3g9L"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":16,"column":1},"end":{"line":16,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"中文","position":{"start":{"line":16,"column":1},"end":{"line":16,"column":1}},"key":"WjsfEhUKtS"}],"identifier":"id","label":"中文","html_id":"id","implicit":true,"key":"BW1NEGuphG"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"position":{"start":{"line":18,"column":1},"end":{"line":18,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"运行检查","position":{"start":{"line":18,"column":1},"end":{"line":18,"column":1}},"key":"VGoOj4o2gS"}],"identifier":"id","label":"运行检查","html_id":"id-1","implicit":true,"key":"D5oeQFOoUN"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":20,"column":1},"end":{"line":20,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"打开一本 Book 并点击 Build。LanCarbon 会在启动 Jupyter Book 前检查全部页面。面板按错误和警告显示结果；能够定位时会显示页面与行号，点击该项可在 Edit 中打开对应页面。","position":{"start":{"line":20,"column":1},"end":{"line":20,"column":1}},"key":"yDaic9EdfD"}],"key":"wR6oo5lLes"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":22,"column":1},"end":{"line":22,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"错误会阻止 Build，包括无效或重复导出路径、页面缺失、尚不支持的 Notebook 页面、YAML frontmatter 格式错误、常见交叉引用重复或无法解析、引用键缺失，以及受管理资源缺失或损坏。警告包括空页面、未填写 Book 作者等仍可生成网站的项目。","position":{"start":{"line":22,"column":1},"end":{"line":22,"column":1}},"key":"PATaR5z5Pc"}],"key":"MXMrkJ4dVF"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":24,"column":1},"end":{"line":24,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"预检采用谨慎规则，最终语法结果仍以官方 Jupyter Book 严格构建为准；CLI 可能发现本地检查器未解释的 MyST 功能。","position":{"start":{"line":24,"column":1},"end":{"line":24,"column":1}},"key":"rI73Mhkx3E"}],"key":"ZpEnkzfUr3"}],"key":"joJI1autF7"}],"key":"ar4bchyj9z"},"references":{"cite":{"order":[],"data":{}}},"footer":{"navigation":{"prev":{"title":"Phase 4 Reference","url":"/index-5","group":"LanCarbon Guide"},"next":{"title":"Build and Saved Website","url":"/build","group":"LanCarbon Guide"}}},"domain":"http://localhost:3000"}